    "",
    "Each track lists the PRIMARY frames only, exactly as app_state_animation",
    "generates them: sprite index = row * columns + column, every frame the same",
    "duration except the last, which is held longer. How a track repeats is a",
    "playback decision (loopPrimary / codexTriple / once), not baked in here."
